    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moredekai okoboria obokonyi korwa ase Esiteri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Moredekai atebeetigwe amang’ana onsi akorirwe, agatandora chianga chiaye, akeboyia chigunia na kweaka ribu, akagenda ase egati y’omochie okorera neriogi rinene, ore nobororo obonge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agaika ase egeita ki’omorwoti. Tasoete, ekiagera monto onde tarenge gwancherwa asoe ase egeita ekio obegete chigunia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ande onsi ase amang’ana ’ogochika koria kw’omorwoti konya ararigwe, Abayahudi bakaba nekerero ekenene mono; bakaba bakweng’ata, bakorera na kobokia amagombo. Abange babo bakaba beboyetie chigunia na beagete ribu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abaiseke abasomba b’Esiteri na abakoreri b’enyomba yaye bamotebeetie amang’ana igoro ya Moredekai, eke agendererete gokora, Esiteri agaichana akaba nobororo obonge; agatomera Moredekai chianga ng’a arusie chigunia abeeke chianga chiria, korende ere agachiaanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Esiteri akarangeria Hataki, oyo omorwoti achorete koba omokoreri bw’Esiteri, akamotoma agende ase Moredekai amoborerie engencho y’amang’ana ayio, naende ninki kiagerire achandegete igo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hataki akagenda ase Moredekai agwo ase eraaro y’omochie, bosio bw’egeita ki’enyomba y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moredekai akamoteebia amang’ana onsi amonyorete; boigo akamoteebia omobaro bwe chitaabu Hamani arire eira kobeeka ase ekungo y’omorwoti, ng’a Abayahudi bonsi baitwe basirigwe kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Moredekai akaa Hataki riruube ririikire amang’ana ’ogochika koria kwaruetwe Susa igoro y’ogosirigwa kw’Abayahudi, erinde orokie Esiteri na amoteebie amang’ana onsi, boigo amoteebie ng’a agende ase omorwoti komosorora na komosaba amaabera ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hataki akagenda, agateebia Esiteri amang’ana onsi Moredekai atebeete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteri agakwana na Hataki, akamoteebia airane ase Moredekai, amoteebie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde bwensi, abe omosacha gose omokungu, oragende ase omorwoti ase egoora ime atarangeiri, goika aitwe akwe. Okwo nogochika. Abasomba bonsi b’omorwoti na abanto bonsi be chingongo chi’oborwoti mbamanyete amang’ana ayio. Enchera neyemo yoka ogotooreka: eraarente onye omorwoti abe okomworotera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "enyimbo yaye y’oborwoti eroisirie korwa ase etaabu, ebe ekemanyererio ng’a rirorio natigwe abe moyo. Korende bono tindarangerigwa kogenda ase omorwoti ase engaki y’omotienyi oyomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Moredekai atebetigwe amang’ana ’Esiteri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamotomera abanto nokoiraneria oko: “Tokaga ng’a ekiagera ore ase enyomba y’omorwoti aye notooreke kobua Abayahudi bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki onye aye kogokira‐kiri kegima ase engaki eye, ogokonywa na ogotooreka nigo korache ase Abayahudi korwa ensemo ende, korende aye na abanto b’enyomba ya iso mosirigwe. Ande, ning’o omanyete gose nase engencho y’engaki buna eye kwabeire eting’ana y’omorwoti?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Esiteri akabatoma ase Moredekai bamoiranerie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda osangererie Abayahudi bonsi bare aa Susa, mweng’ate ase engencho yane. Timoria gose konywa ase amatuko atato, omobaso na obotuko. Inche amo nabasomba baane abaiseke ntweng’ate boigo. Nyuma y’ayio ningende ase omorwoti mamincha y’amachiiko; onye ngochia gosirigwa, insirigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Moredekai akagenda, agakora onsi buna Esiteri amochigeete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
